---
source: default-plugins/status-bar/src/keybind_hints.rs
expression: listing
---
== Pane
wide:   n [New] ←↓↑→ [Change Focus] x [Close] c [Rename] f [Toggle Fullscreen] w [Toggle Floating] e [Toggle Embed] r [Split Right] d [Split Down] s [Stack] v [Select text] ENTER [Select pane]
tight:  n [New] ←↓↑→ [Move] x [Close] c [Rename] ... 

== Tab
wide:   n [New] ←→ [Change focus] x [Close] r [Rename] s [Sync] b [Break pane to new tab] [] [Break pane left/right] TAB [Toggle] ENTER [Select pane]
tight:  n [New] ←→ [Move] x [Close] r [Rename] s [Sync] ... 

== Session
wide:   d [Detach] w [Session Manager] c [Configure] l [Layout Manager] p [Plugin Manager] n [Notifications] ENTER [Select pane]
tight:  d [Detach] w [Manager] c [Config] l [Layouts] ... 

== Move
wide:   ←↓↑→ [Switch Location] ENTER [When done]
tight:  ←↓↑→ [Switch Location] ENTER [When done]
